{"sha": "d82d1e5d5ef9c242b4c8338714b89dd19e4af8caa1fac48385b0bb424320bf8e", "body": ["\\begin{theorem}[柯尔莫哥洛夫 0--1 律]", "\\label{thm:b3:probability:zeroone}", "设 $(X_n)$ 独立，记 $\\mathcal T =", "\\bigcap_N\\sigma(X_N, X_{N+1}, \\dots)$ 称为\\emph{尾", "$\\sigma$-代数}\\index{尾 $\\sigma$-代数}（对有限个", "$X_n$ 的任意改变都不敏感的事件：$\\sum X_n$ 的收敛性、", "$\\frac{S_n}n$ 的收敛性、$\\limsup$ 的取值，\\dots）。", "则每个 $T \\in \\mathcal T$ 都满足 $\\P(T) \\in \\{0,", "1\\}$。\\index{0--1 律}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "固定 $N$。$\\sigma$-代数 $\\sigma(X_1, \\dots, X_N)$ 与", "$\\sigma(X_{N+1}, \\dots)$ 独立：依赖于不相交变量块的事件，", "在相应的生成 $\\pi$-系上乘积分解", "（柱集 $\\bigcap_{i\\leq N}\\{X_i \\in B_i\\}$，分别为", "关于后续变量的有限条件），再由 Dynkin", "（\\cref{thm:b3:measure:dynkin}，两次应用，", "每次一侧）将分解式推广。尾事件 $T$ 属于", "$\\sigma(X_{N+1}, \\dots)$（对每个 $N$）：$T$ 与", "每个 $\\sigma(X_1, \\dots, X_N)$ 独立，故与", "它们生成的 $\\sigma$-代数 $\\sigma(X_1, X_2, \\dots)$ 独立（再用一次 Dynkin：", "各 $\\sigma(X_1,\\dots,X_N)$ 的并是生成它的 $\\pi$-系）。", "但 $T \\in \\sigma(X_1, X_2, \\dots)$ 也成立：$T$", "与\\emph{自身}独立，$\\P(T) = \\P(T\\cap T) =", "\\P(T)^2$，故 $\\P(T) \\in \\{0, 1\\}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{收敛方式}", "", "\\begin{definition}\\label{def:b3:probability:modes}", "$X_n \\to X$ \\emph{几乎必然收敛}，若 $\\P(X_n \\to X) = 1$；", "\\emph{依概率收敛}，若 $\\P(\\abs{X_n - X} \\geq \\varepsilon)", "\\to 0$ 对每个 $\\varepsilon > 0$ 成立；\\emph{$L^p$ 收敛}，若", "$\\E\\abs{X_n - X}^p \\to 0$。\\index{随机变量的", "收敛}", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:b3:probability:modes}", "(a) 几乎必然收敛蕴含依概率收敛；", "(b) $L^p$ 收敛蕴含依概率收敛；", "(c) 依概率收敛蕴含", "\\emph{沿某一子列}几乎必然收敛；", "(d) 一般而言不存在其他蕴含关系。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "(a) $\\P(\\abs{X_n - X} \\geq \\varepsilon) \\leq", "\\P\\bigl(\\sup_{m\\geq n}\\abs{X_m - X} \\geq \\varepsilon\\bigr)", "\\downarrow \\P\\bigl(\\limsup\\{\\abs{X_m - X} \\geq", "\\varepsilon\\}\\bigr) = 0$（几乎必然收敛下成立，", "由上连续性；limsup 事件排除了收敛）。(b)", "马尔可夫不等式：$\\P(\\abs{X_n - X} \\geq \\varepsilon) \\leq", "\\varepsilon^{-p}\\,\\E\\abs{X_n - X}^p$。(c) 取 $n_k$，使", "$\\P(\\abs{X_{n_k} - X} \\geq 2^{-k}) \\leq 2^{-k}$；", "由博雷尔–坎泰利 (1)，$\\abs{X_{n_k} - X} < 2^{-k}$", "最终几乎必然成立。(d) 打字机序列（见\\cref{exo:b3:lp:3}）在", "$(\\intcc01, \\lambda)$ 上依 $L^1$ 收敛且依概率收敛，", "但处处不逐点收敛；$n\\mathbf 1_{\\intoo0{1/n}} \\to 0$", "几乎必然收敛，但不在 $L^1$ 中收敛；细节及其余反例见", "\\cref{exo:b3:probability:6}。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{大数定律}", "", "全文 $(X_n)$ 独立同分布", "（\\emph{i.i.d.}），记 $S_n = X_1 + \\dots + X_n$。", "", "\\begin{theorem}[弱大数定律]", "\\label{thm:b3:probability:wlln}", "若 $X_1 \\in L^2$，记 $m = \\E X_1$：", "\\[", "\\P\\Bigl(\\Bigl|\\frac{S_n}{n} - m\\Bigr| \\geq", "\\varepsilon\\Bigr) \\leq", "\\frac{\\V(X_1)}{n\\,\\varepsilon^2}", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{} 0 :", "\\]", "$\\frac{S_n}n \\to m$ 依概率收敛（且在 $L^2$ 中收敛）。\\index{弱大数", "定律}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\E\\frac{S_n}n = m$，且 $\\V\\bigl(\\frac{S_n}n\\bigr) =", "\\frac{n\\V(X_1)}{n^2}$", "由\\cref{thm:b3:probability:independence}及切比雪夫不等式可得。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[强大数定律]", "\\label{thm:b3:probability:slln}", "若 $X_1 \\in L^1$，则\\index{强大数定律}", "\\[", "\\frac{S_n}{n} \\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{\\text{几乎必然}} \\E[X_1].", "\\]", "此处仅在更强的假设 $X_1 \\in", "L^4$ 下证明；一般情形（$L^1$，埃特马迪的证明）为", "周末问题。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[在 $\\E X_1^4 < \\infty$ 下的证明]", "中心化（$X_i \\mapsto X_i - m$），不妨设 $m = 0$。展开：", "\\[", "\\E[S_n^4] = \\sum_{i,j,k,l}\\E[X_iX_jX_kX_l]", "= n\\,\\E[X_1^4] + 3n(n-1)\\,\\bigl(\\E[X_1^2]\\bigr)^2 \\leq", "C\\,n^2 ,", "\\]", "由于独立性与中心化，所有含", "孤立因子的项皆为零（$\\E[X_iX_jX_kX_l] =", "\\E[X_i]\\E[\\cdots] = 0$，除非指标两两配对：唯一", "幸存的只有 $n$ 项 $i=j=k=l$，以及", "$3n(n-1)$ 个含两对不同指标的项）。马尔可夫不等式：", "\\[", "\\P\\Bigl(\\Bigl|\\frac{S_n}n\\Bigr| \\geq \\varepsilon\\Bigr)", "= \\P\\bigl(S_n^4 \\geq n^4\\varepsilon^4\\bigr)", "\\leq \\frac{Cn^2}{n^4\\varepsilon^4} =", "\\frac{C}{\\varepsilon^4n^2},", "\\]", "该级数收敛。由博雷尔–坎泰利 (1)，对每个有理数", "$\\varepsilon$，$\\abs{S_n/n} < \\varepsilon$ 最终成立，", "几乎必然；对 $\\varepsilon \\in \\Q_+^*$ 取交（", "可数个概率为 $1$ 的事件）：$S_n/n \\to 0$ 几乎必然。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}